#### 2. 创建需求状态枚举
**文件路径：** `lib/features/orders/domain/entities/order_demand_status.dart`

```dart
enum OrderDemandStatus {
  wait('WAIT', '待审核'),
  success('SUCCESS', '审核通过'),
  fail('FAIL', '拒绝'),
  cancel('CANCEL', '取消');
  
  const OrderDemandStatus(this.value, this.label);
  final String value;
  final String label;
  
  static OrderDemandStatus fromString(String? value) {
    return OrderDemandStatus.values.firstWhere(
      (status) => status.value == value,
      orElse: () => OrderDemandStatus.wait,
    );
  }
}
```

